`pm_prep_refused_01`, `pm_hold_01`, `pm_demob_01`, `pm_end_slice`, `radio_ack_01`, `radio_notdone_01`, 
`foreman_held_01` to `foreman_held_03` (Dana). Removed, replaced by the exchanges below: `foreman_pipe_arg_slice`, 
`foreman_back_arg_01`. For the two Texas stages, use the same lines with "seven-twenty" in place of "five-twenty" and 
"fifteen hundred" for the zone 1 boundary.
