  Docs\DECISIONS.md:6:
  Docs\DECISIONS.md:7:| # | Decision | Why | Where it lives |
  Docs\DECISIONS.md:8:| --- | --- | --- | --- |
  Docs\DECISIONS.md:9:| K1 | The PC hosts the simulation; the Quest is a client; browser pages are the Plan seat and 
the 2D Site fallback for good | One protocol, one truth; Zoom and no-headset play for free; the Unity host can be 
skipped for the demo | `Docs/PROTOCOL.md`, `Docs/ROADMAP.md` |
